			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Thank you so much for your loving words about our wonderful son Eric.  We are so very happy that he inspired you, and we&#8217;re thankful that his encouragement will help you to carry on the work that he loved so much.<br />
Several years ago, after he had started his flying lessons, he told me that, had he taken the lessons when he was a teenager, he would have become a pilot instead of an engineer.  He loved flying so much, and I truly picture his soul flying so very freely in the universe.  His spirit will always be with us.<br />
Betsy Mudama</p>
